# Source of truth for team practices

Other engineers use **VS Code + GitHub Copilot**, not Cursor.

- **Canonical team instructions:** `.github/copilot-instructions.md`
- **Path-scoped:** `.github/instructions/*.instructions.md`
- **Reusable prompts:** `.github/prompts/*.prompt.md`

When changing coding standards or package boundaries, **update `.github/` first**, then mirror briefly here if needed. Do not invent Cursor-only rules that contradict `.github/copilot-instructions.md`.
